OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly cloudy day with some
OL,6,Fbright or sunny spells at times, these
OL,7,Fmainly in the east and early in the
OL,8,Fday. Showers over Argyll in the
OL,9,Fmorning will spread east to all areas
OL,10,Fthrough the afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA mostly cloudy evening with
OL,13,Fa few showers lingering but gradually
OL,14,Feasing. Overnight will be mostly dry
OL,15,Fwith some clearer spells developing.
OL,16,FNot quite as cold as previous night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
