OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FIt will be a mostly dry and
OL,6,Fcloudy day but with some bright
OL,7,Fintervals breaking through. Outbreaks
OL,8,Fof rain possible over Ayrshire and
OL,9,FGlasgow in the afternoon. Windy at
OL,10,Ftimes.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FWindy
OL,13,Fon Sunday with rain, turning wintry
OL,14,Fover the hills, and to lower levels at
OL,15,Ftimes. Showers spreading south Monday,
OL,16,Fwintry over hills. Sunny spells and
OL,17,Flargely dry on Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
